# Python-generated files
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info

# Virtual environments
.venv/

# Generated analysis output — regenerable, and large (filter_compare_results
# alone is ~360 MB for a 7-frequency sweep across all 11 files, once the
# interactive Plotly overlays and their bundled plotly.min.js are included).
#
# NOT ignored, deliberately: data-analysis/regression_expected.json — the
# pinned numbers, whose diff IS the record of what changed and why.
data-analysis/filter_compare_results/
data-analysis/review_cutoffs/
data-analysis/plots/

# Generated on demand, not kept in the repo — a blank worksheet in version
# control implies outstanding work that is not outstanding. The cutoff
# decision itself lives in data-analysis/case_common.py.
data-analysis/cutoff_decisions.yaml
data-analysis/cutoff_decisions.yaml.new
data-analysis/*.xlsx
data-analysis/*.docx
